# Board process mandatory (Rodieja Contable)

Product repo — every change uses `.linear` + worktrees + `.docs` (Spring harness discipline, WordPress stack).

Never: drive-by `main`, skip worktrees, stub journeys, fake LANDED.

Always: journey story → claim → worktree-add → checklist/evidence → testing → finish → integrate → summarize/handoff → push → land to `origin/main`.

WP: native-first · Contracts → Repos → Services → Controllers · DI · layer-audit green.
